  (text "MIDI OUT: 5 mA current loop at 3.3 V (MIDI CA-033)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b71154ec-c002-551a-9563-2b1fbb0212ff"))
  (text "J401 MIDI OUT, rear panel: DIN-5 180 deg female." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a55ad2ef-ff87-5834-bceb-4f4607caa3a4"))
  (text "Pin 4 = +3.3 V through RA = R403 33 R 0.5 W," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "50b54e4c-95c5-59b0-82de-c1c60677f7a8"))
  (text "pin 5 = data through RC = R402 10 R (CA-033, 3.3 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8b79a278-bac4-5e6c-9b9c-ca890bc73fb4"))
  (text "Pin 2 to GND (transmitter side only); pins 1/3 and" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9652d3c5-987d-56ee-b8f0-dc3510c5ceb6"))
  (text "the shell are not connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9780ff25-2118-5e8f-803f-478b3920a82d"))
  (text "U401 buffers GPIO 0 (UART0 TX, 31250 baud 8N1) and sinks the loop current: about 7 mA into a 6N138 input" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "635bd647-446f-5fa7-b165-3d0ddb362fb1"))
  (text "(3.3 V - 1.4 V - 0.1 V) / (33 + 10 + 220) R. Logical 0 = current on. R401 keeps the line idle (no current)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6878cd64-84d8-51bb-b93f-30b1117be9e9"))
  (text "until the UART runs. FB401/FB402: optional RF filter beads (1 kOhm at 100 MHz, e.g. MMZ1608Y102BT); fit 0 R links if unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4757c146-8d26-56c9-838b-8af660df91d4"))
  (text "MIDI IN: opto-isolated receiver (reserved in firmware)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0e6cf2ef-23bd-542b-ba7b-8518b6b58795"))
  (text "J402 MIDI IN, rear panel: DIN-5 180 deg female." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e79ff561-c569-50d1-b4ad-366fc6e36b79"))
  (text "No jack pin touches GND: pin 2 and the shell stay" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5af47fbb-f2fc-56a8-a1a3-96b732edf874"))
  (text "open (CA-033); pins 1/3 not used." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "54033e63-5e9d-50ef-a7e3-a1335ff8320c"))
  (text "R404 220 R limits the loop current, D401 protects" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3655ba20-bec9-5e9a-ba16-f2aab249f673"))
  (text "the opto LED against reversed polarity." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "af8eb40f-a28e-5721-b18c-6c929e20d6e1"))
  (text "U402 H11L1: Schmitt-trigger opto, 3-15 V, turns on below 1.6 mA, open-collector output pulled up by R405." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 146.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6ded6bf7-ab2c-50c8-b925-119af7e8995f"))
  (text "Idle loop (no current) = output high = UART idle. GPIO 1 is UART0 RX; the firmware keeps MIDI IN reserved." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d89c1852-7fd1-529c-8841-64699d3bd35b"))
